== Trivia ==
* The item is a reference to ''[[bulbapedia:Pokémon GO|Pokémon GO]]'': an augmented reality mobile game in which Pokémon are generated around the player as they walk around in real life.
** The pickup quote is a shortened version of "Gotta catch 'em all!", one of the series' marketing slogans.
** "A charmed (enemy) appears!" is a reference to the phrase "A wild Pokémon appears!" from the games.
* Poke Go was originally an unofficial item which was supposed to showcase the modding capabilities of Afterbirth+ in the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FRR-wzTky9Q PAX 2016 livestream]. However, all items included in the demo were later added to the final game.
* Since Poke Go is simply part of Isaac's imagination, Edmund McMillen confirmed that Isaac therefore [https://twitter.com/edmundmcmillen/status/1486229380690898946 technically knew about Pokémon Go].

== Bugs ==
